###create step
POST http://localhost:3000/steps
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "luid": 1,
    "steps":1200,
    "date":"2026-10-12"

}
###get steps

GET http://localhost:3000/steps/:uid
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "uid": 1,
    "luid":1

}
###update steps
PATCH http://localhost:3000/steps/:uid/:stepID
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "uid": 1,
    "stepID":1

}
###delete steps
DELETE http://localhost:3000/steps/:stepID
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "stepID":1
}